abstract: >
  Multilingual public reading repository for Qubit of Hope — Volume II. This repository preserves imported publication assets in Russian, French, Spanish, German, English, Dutch, and Simplified Chinese, exposes them in canonical reader and machine-readable layout, documents naming/version drift instead of silently normalizing it, and remains all rights reserved. Post-deposit DOI synchronization. No literary text or cover artwork changed.
